From 5c85a726c5319ca713ac3b15fddbc7a3a9ee6db0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Connor Abbott <cwabbott0@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 13:06:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 20/33] ir3: Map ACCESS_NON_TEMPORAL loads/store to ldthr/stthr

These will be used internally by ray-tracing.
---
 src/freedreno/ir3/ir3.h      |  4 ++++
 src/freedreno/ir3/ir3_a6xx.c | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 2 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3.h b/src/freedreno/ir3/ir3.h
